# Documentation updates

Update docs in the same change as the code. See `CONTRIBUTING.md`.

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| User-facing behavior (modes, buttons, data paths, placeholders) | README + RUNBOOK + CHANGELOG |
| Install, launch, troubleshooting | RUNBOOK + CHANGELOG |
| Internal refactor, same UX | CHANGELOG only |
| New or renamed data files | README + RUNBOOK trees and «Как обновлять данные» + CHANGELOG |

- Keep a Changelog: add a bullet under `[Unreleased]` or the current version.
- Do not leave templates in the repo root. Horoscope files are `horoscope_*.md`, never `horoscop_*.md`.
- Do not invent a legacy `.cursorrules` file; use `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.
